  "body": "## What changed\nClicking **Orthographic** blanked the viewport (#600, reported with a headless repro: perspective painted 9,326 px, ortho 0).\n- **Root cause:** `Camera::mvp`'s ortho branch (`crates/ui/src/viewport.rs`) used OpenGL's depth row (−1..1), but WebGPU keeps clip z only in 0..w. With ortho's w = 1, everything nearer than (near+far)/2, about 20× the orbit distance, was clipped.\n- **Fix:** `[2][2] = 1/(near−far)`, `[3][2] = near/(near−far)`, so near maps to 0, far to 1, linear in between. The depth test (`Less` against a 1.0 clear) is unchanged.\n- **Unchanged:**\n  - Perspective, which survives with positive w.\n  - Picking, `dolly_cursor`, `vertex_pick` and the overlays, which use only x/y/w.\n  - The traced-stock composite, which already assumed the WebGPU range.\n- **Decision record:** `docs/decisions/600-ortho-depth.md`. The ortho near plane stays at the eye plane, which keeps the #434 pick-ray laws, and the perspective row is left alone.\n\n## How tested\n- **New unit test:** `projection_tests::ortho_depth_spans_wgpus_zero_to_one_clip_range`. Near → 0, far → 1, midpoint → 0.5, and the target plane lies between them. It failed before the fix (\"near maps to 0, got -1\").\n- **New GPU test:** `gpu_render::ortho_box_stock_paints_like_perspective`, the issue's repro: ortho paints more than half of perspective's pixels. **It skips on this machine (no GPU adapter)**, so it needs a GPU run, or a hands-on check of clicking Orthographic.\n- **Gate:** ui lib 377 passes; the headless-GPU test fails only on this machine. Clippy is clean.\n\n## Found, not fixed (follow-ups)\n- The traced-stock sim view always casts perspective rays, so in ortho it won't line up with the meshes.\n- `vertex_pick`'s ortho visibility check tests along the line to the eye point, not the parallel view direction.\n\nChangelog: Orthographic projection draws the scene again: its depth now maps to WebGPU's 0..1 clip range instead of OpenGL's -1..1, which clipped the whole model (#600)\n\nFixes #600\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
